message: If you use this resource, please cite it as below.
title: 'Diabetes distress: interactive evidence map'
abstract: 'An interactive evidence map of diabetes distress in adults and young people with diabetes:
  a PubMed landscape of 2,438 records classified by study design, pooled effect estimates from
  randomised trials, diabetes distress instruments and their validated language versions, and
  the recommendations of the EASD, ADA, ISPAD, NICE and SIGN guidelines.'
